Third-party data
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

modules/core/src/main/resources/places/
  countries.tsv, countries_<lang>.tsv
  subdivisions.tsv, subdivisions_<lang>.tsv

    Derived from Debian iso-codes (ISO 3166-1 and ISO 3166-2 codes, names,
    and translations), licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public License
    version 2.1 or later.
    https://salsa.debian.org/iso-codes-team/iso-codes

    Only the data tables are derived; no iso-codes program code is
    incorporated or linked. Regenerate with scripts/build-places.sh.

  cities.tsv, cities_<lang>.tsv

    Derived from the GeoNames geographical database, licensed under the
    Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 License.
    https://www.geonames.org/
    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

    Trimmed to the columns Promovolve uses (id, name, country, subdivision,
    population) plus localised names. Regenerate with
    scripts/build-places.sh.

modules/core/src/main/resources/iab_content_taxonomy/

    IAB Content Taxonomy, published by IAB Tech Lab.
    https://iabtechlab.com/standards/content-taxonomy/
